< a/docs/guide/devtools.md +For URL headers and redirect locations, a fragment containing sensitive parameters (including hash-router query parameters) is replaced in full with `[REDACTED]`. Fragment syntax is application-defined, so DevTools does not try to reconstruct a fragment after removing a secret. Harmless fragments stay byte-for-byte unchanged, and redaction never changes the live redirect sent to the browser.
